            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Declare that the process to complete a loan is being initiated. A loan can immediately be completed if there are no outstanding fundings being processed. If there are outstanding fundings being processed the loan well be marked as pending completion until those fundings have been successfully processed which will trigger completing the loan. Once completed the loan can no longer be funded."
